# Density Compare
# Ruthenium (Ru) — real density 12.45 g/cm³. equal masses: Ruthenium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Ruthenium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 8.6mm color: #a0c0c0 at (-20mm, 4.3mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 99.3 g — the water cube is the reference
